@page "/"

<PageTitle>Book a room · Harbour Lane Community Centre</PageTitle>

<section class="hero">
    <video class="hero-video" src="https://media.harbourlane.org/site/centre-loop.mp4" autoplay loop muted playsinline
           poster="images/hero-poster.svg"></video>
    <div class="hero-text">
        <h1 class="hero-title">Rooms for every kind of get-together</h1>
        <p>Meetings, classes, parties and rehearsals — book a room at Harbour Lane in a few minutes.</p>
        <a class="button" href="rooms">Find a room</a>
    </div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="getting-here">
    <h2 id="getting-here">Getting here and getting around</h2>
    <div class="feature-grid">
        <figure>
            <img src="images/floorplan.svg" alt="Ground-floor plan: the main hall on the left, the workshop on the right, the lift and toilets behind the foyer" width="320" height="220" />
            <figcaption>The ground floor</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure>
            <img src="images/step-free-entrance.svg" alt="The step-free entrance from the car park, with automatic doors and a level threshold" width="320" height="220" />
            <figcaption>Step-free entrance</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure>
            <img src="images/foyer.svg" alt="foyer-1920.svg" width="320" height="220" />
            <figcaption>The foyer and café</figcaption>
        </figure>
    </div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="hiring">
    <h2 id="hiring">Hiring a room</h2>
    <p>Rooms are booked by the hour between 08:00 and 22:00. Community groups get the first hour of every booking free.</p>
    <p>Before your first booking, read the conditions of hire — <a href="terms">click here</a>.</p>
    <p><a href="calendar">See this week's bookings</a> or <a href="rooms">browse the rooms</a>.</p>
</section>
